## Section 2: System Overview

### 2.1 User Roles

| Role | Access | Authentication |
|------|--------|----------------|
| Admin | Full system access | Username + Password + TOTP (2FA) |
| Portal Member | Specific portal only | Magic link → Session cookie |
| Visitor | Public content | None |

**Note:** The system currently supports a single admin account. Multi-admin is deferred to Phase 3.

### 2.2 Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| Content Editor | Block-based (vertical editor) | No design decisions for writer |
| Block System | 10 semantic blocks | Fixed schema, structured content |
| Templates | Structural only | Define which blocks allowed + order |
| Client Delivery | Portal Wall per trip | Replaces document repository model |
| Portal Auth | Magic link → session cookie | No passwords for clients |
| Itinerary | Separate content type, not block | Chronology-driven, not prominence-driven |
| Flights | Travel segments (no separate table) | Simplifies hierarchy |
| Stays | Belong to one section | No cross-section spans |
| Admin Notepad | Comma-separated tags (V1) | People table upgrade trigger defined |
| Draft Durability | localStorage (synchronous) | Single-device, critical data integrity |
| Autosave | Debounced with dirty-tracking | Prevents silent work loss |
| Theme | Curated palettes + named presets | No raw colour pickers |
| Background | Fixed white | Professional standard |
| Status Colours | Fixed (never themeable) | Universal meaning |
| Dark Mode | Deferred (reader preference) | Separate from branding |
| Storage | SQLite (better-sqlite3) | Already working |
| Testing | Vitest + Testing Library | Critical data-integrity code requires tests |

