## Section 5: Content Library

### 5.1 Overview

Reusable content authored once, referenced by multiple portals.

### 5.2 Data Model

`content_library` table:
- `id`, `title`, `description`
- `type`: `pdf` | `image` | `text`
- `category`: `guide` | `checklist` | `faq` | `alert` | `document` | `other`
- `file_path`, `text_content`
- `created_at`, `deleted_at`

### 5.3 Behaviour

- Categories drive filtering, never rendering
- Referenced by `portal_items`, never copied
- Editing library item updates all portals using it
- Portal can detach/freeze an item if needed

