## Section 8: Admin Notepad

### 8.1 Overview

Private, admin-only scratchpad per portal for logistics that aren't part of the itinerary.

### 8.2 Data Model

`notepad_entries` table:
- `id`, `portal_id`
- `content` (text)
- `tags` (comma-separated names)
- `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`

### 8.3 Behaviour

- Never rendered to clients
- Search by content or tag
- Autocomplete from portal members + previously-used tags
- TagInput pattern only (no coupling to post-tag backend)

### 8.4 Data Guardrail

Logistics notes only (dietary needs, mobility, preferences). No diagnostic detail, treatment information, or medical history.

