## Section 11: Authentication & Security

### 11.1 Admin Auth

- Username + password (hashed)
- TOTP (2FA) optional per-user
- Lucia sessions
- Brute-force protection (rate limiting)
- Password change flow

### 11.2 Portal Auth

- Magic link → session cookie
- Rate limited
- Session expires based on trip return date + 3 days (or 30 days fallback)
- Logout destroys session

### 11.3 Audit Logging

- `activity_log` table
- Used across: portal create/update/archive/delete, member add/remove, preview access, settings changes, login attempts, media uploads

### 11.4 Data Protection

- PIPEDA-compliant retention policy
- Soft deletes for user content
- Email suppressions for opt-outs
- PII isolation (notepad vs post-tags)

