## Section 14: Non-Functional Requirements

### 14.1 Performance

- Feed: infinite scroll, lazy loading
- Autosave: 500ms debounce, localStorage writes synchronous
- Print export: browser-native

### 14.2 Reliability

- Autosave never blocks editing
- localStorage failures swallowed
- Draft durability prevents silent work loss
- React state updates gated by mount; refs + localStorage always update

### 14.3 Security

- Rate limiting on auth endpoints
- Soft deletes for user content
- Activity logging for audit trail
- PII isolation (notepad data separate from low-stakes tags)

### 14.4 Accessibility

- Semantic HTML
- ARIA labels on interactive elements
- Keyboard navigation

